windows.svg, apple.svg and linux.svg are Font Awesome Free brand icons, copied from
@fortawesome/fontawesome-free 7.3.1 (svgs/brands/). Two changes, neither to the paths:
- the fill colour: fill="currentColor" became fill="#9198a1", so the icons read on GitHub's
  light and dark themes;
- the viewBox: each became a 512 x 512 square with the glyph centred horizontally
  (windows and linux: "0 0 448 512" to "-32 0 512 512"; apple: "0 0 384 512" to
  "-64 0 512 512"), so the three icons share one frame and sit the same distance from their names.

The README's platform chip (docs/assets/readme/platforms-dark.svg and platforms-light.svg, drawn by
tools/scripts/readme-art.ts) embeds the same three paths, unchanged, with only their fill recoloured.

